---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.endsWith('/')
  ? import.meta.env.BASE_URL
  : `${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/`;

const heroImage = `${base}ranktwig-demo/search-beneath-surface.webp`;
const rankTwigUrl = 'https://ranktwig.com';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#070b0b" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow, noarchive, nosnippet" />
    <meta name="googlebot" content="noindex, nofollow, noarchive, nosnippet" />
    <meta name="description" content="A private design experiment for the RankTwig homepage." />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href={`${base}ranktwig-demo/ranktwig-mark.svg`} />
    <title>RankTwig homepage experiment</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <a class="skip-link" href="#main-content">Skip to the evidence</a>

    <header class="site-header">
      <a class="brand" href="#top" aria-label="RankTwig home">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" aria-hidden="true">
          <rect width="40" height="40" rx="10" fill="currentColor"></rect>
          <path d="M8.5 30.2c4.1-3 7.7-6.4 10-10.2 1.7-2.8 2.7-5.8 3.1-9.3.1-1.1 1.8-1.1 1.9 0 .1 2.8-.6 5.6-1.4 7.7 2.7-2.1 5.5-4 8.4-5.7.9-.5 1.7.7 1.1 1.5-4.4 6.3-10.5 10.7-17.6 13 4.2.1 8 .8 11.4 2.1 1 .4.8 1.9-.3 2-5.6-.4-11.2-.8-18 1.6-1 .3-1.7-1.1-.8-1.7 1.6-1.2 2.1-1.8 2.6-2.7Z" fill="white"></path>
        </svg>
        <span>RankTwig</span>
      </a>

      <nav aria-label="Primary navigation">
        <a href="#inside">Product</a>
        <a href="#how-it-works">How it works</a>
        <a href="#pricing">Pricing</a>
      </nav>

      <a class="header-action" href={`${rankTwigUrl}/login?intent=connect-gsc`}>Try for free <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </header>

    <main id="main-content">
      <section id="top" class="hero" style={`--hero-image: url('${heroImage}')`} aria-labelledby="hero-title">
        <div class="hero-veil" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="hero-inner">
          <div class="hero-copy">
            <p class="eyebrow"><span></span> Evidence-first SEO intelligence <b aria-hidden="true">→</b></p>
            <h1 id="hero-title">See what search data is trying to tell you.</h1>
            <p class="hero-intro">
              Find the pages, queries and opportunities worth acting on—then see the evidence behind every recommendation.
            </p>
            <div class="hero-actions">
              <a class="button button--orange" href={`${rankTwigUrl}/login?intent=connect-gsc`}>Try RankTwig <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
              <a class="button button--quiet" href={`${rankTwigUrl}/demo`}>Explore RankTwig</a>
            </div>
            <ul class="hero-notes" aria-label="Product highlights">
              <li>Read-only GSC</li>
              <li>Bring your own AI</li>
              <li>ChatGPT + MCP</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="hero-caption">Follow the orange trail.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="opening shell" aria-labelledby="opening-title">
        <p class="section-number">00 / THE SMALL ANNOYANCE</p>
        <div class="opening-grid">
          <h2 id="opening-title">Search Console tells you what happened. Then it leaves you with the archaeology.</h2>
          <div class="opening-copy">
            <p>
              I built RankTwig because useful SEO evidence was already sitting there—queries, pages, impressions, changes—but turning it into one sensible next action still took too many tabs.
            </p>
            <p class="aside-note">RankTwig keeps the source, date range and limitations attached. No mysterious “SEO score” pretending to know everything.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="how-it-works" class="trail-section" aria-labelledby="trail-title">
        <div class="shell">
          <div class="section-heading">
            <p class="section-number">01 / FOLLOW THE EVIDENCE</p>
            <h2 id="trail-title">One signal becomes a clear next move.</h2>
            <p>Start with demand your site already earns. Investigate before rewriting. Keep every recommendation tied to something observable.</p>
          </div>

          <ol class="trail-list">
            <li>
              <span class="trail-index">01</span>
              <div><strong>Find</strong><p>Surface striking-distance queries, CTR gaps, rising demand, declines and cannibalization.</p></div>
              <span class="trail-proof">From connected GSC data</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="trail-index">02</span>
              <div><strong>Investigate</strong><p>Bring the page, its queries, performance changes and a fresh bounded crawl together.</p></div>
              <span class="trail-proof">Metrics + current page facts</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="trail-index">03</span>
              <div><strong>Compare</strong><p>Put your page beside a public competitor and see where the observable differences actually are.</p></div>
              <span class="trail-proof">Page Battle</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="trail-index">04</span>
              <div><strong>Act</strong><p>Turn the evidence into a focused update, a useful content brief or a conversation with your AI.</p></div>
              <span class="trail-proof trail-proof--orange">One defensible next move</span>
            </li>
          </ol>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="inside" class="work-section shell" aria-labelledby="work-title">
        <div class="section-heading section-heading--wide">
          <p class="section-number">02 / INSIDE RANKTWIG</p>
          <h2 id="work-title">Four ways to stop guessing.</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="work-list">
          <article>
            <div class="work-meta"><span>PAGE INVESTIGATOR</span><span>01</span></div>
            <h3>Understand a page before changing it.</h3>
            <p>See performance, ranking queries and current page evidence together. Add your AI only when you want another layer of reasoning.</p>
            <div class="evidence-strip" aria-label="Example evidence trail">
              <span>28-day comparison</span><i>→</i><span>Top queries</span><i>→</i><span>Fresh crawl</span><i>→</i><strong>Next action</strong>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article>
            <div class="work-meta"><span>PAGE BATTLE</span><span>02</span></div>
            <h3>See where the competing page has an edge.</h3>
            <p>Compare titles, headings, links, schema and other observed facts without turning one competitor URL into fake certainty.</p>
            <dl class="mini-ledger">
              <div><dt>Your page</dt><dd>Useful guide · weak decision section</dd></div>
              <div><dt>Competitor</dt><dd>Clear comparison · stronger trust cues</dd></div>
              <div><dt>Move</dt><dd>Fix the decision section first</dd></div>
            </dl>
          </article>

          <article>
            <div class="work-meta"><span>CONTENT BRIEF</span><span>03</span></div>
            <h3>Build from what your site already knows.</h3>
            <p>Use Search Console evidence, existing pages and competitor sources you choose. RankTwig checks overlap before inventing another article.</p>
            <ul class="brief-lines">
              <li><span>01</span>Existing demand and intent</li>
              <li><span>02</span>Overlap risk with current pages</li>
              <li><span>03</span>Useful internal-link candidates</li>
            </ul>
          </article>

          <article>
            <div class="work-meta"><span>CHATGPT + MCP</span><span>04</span></div>
            <h3>Bring the evidence into the conversation.</h3>
            <p>Connect RankTwig once, then ask naturally. Your compatible AI client can request the page, query and opportunity evidence it needs.</p>
            <div class="chat-example">
              <p class="chat-user">Bro, what should I work on today?</p>
              <p class="chat-answer"><strong>Start with /best-service-guide/.</strong> It already has demand, but the queries around positions 18–29 are not earning enough clicks. Fix the snippet and decision section before rewriting the page.</p>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="proof-section" aria-labelledby="proof-title">
        <div class="shell proof-grid">
          <div>
            <p class="section-number">03 / SHOW THE WORK</p>
            <h2 id="proof-title">Never wonder why the AI said that.</h2>
            <p>Observed data, calculated signals and AI inference remain distinguishable. When the evidence is thin, RankTwig should say so.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="proof-ledger">
            <div><span>Observed</span><strong>Clicks fell while rankings held</strong><small>GSC · current 28 days vs prior 28 days</small></div>
            <div><span>Observed</span><strong>High-impression queries still match the page</strong><small>Connected query evidence</small></div>
            <div><span>Calculated</span><strong>CTR gap deserves investigation</strong><small>Deterministic RankTwig signal</small></div>
            <div class="proof-ledger__answer"><span>Next move</span><strong>Start with the title and snippet</strong><small>AI reasoning checked against the evidence</small></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="ai-section shell" aria-labelledby="ai-title">
        <p class="section-number">04 / YOUR AI, NOT OUR CREDIT BUNDLE</p>
        <div class="ai-grid">
          <div>
            <h2 id="ai-title">Bring the model you already trust.</h2>
            <p>Connect OpenAI, Claude, Gemini, DeepSeek or OpenRouter. RankTwig provides the search context; your provider handles the model.</p>
          </div>
          <ul>
            <li><span>OpenAI</span><small>Your key</small></li>
            <li><span>Claude</span><small>Your key</small></li>
            <li><span>Gemini</span><small>Your key</small></li>
            <li><span>DeepSeek</span><small>Your key</small></li>
            <li><span>OpenRouter</span><small>Your key</small></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <p class="hand-note">No RankTwig AI credits. No model markup. The estimate appears before supported AI runs.</p>
      </section>

      <section id="pricing" class="pricing-section" aria-labelledby="pricing-title">
        <div class="shell">
          <div class="section-heading">
            <p class="section-number">05 / START SMALL</p>
            <h2 id="pricing-title">Use the real product for free.</h2>
            <p>Not a seven-day tour. Connect one website, use BYOK AI and see whether RankTwig earns a place in your workflow.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="plans">
            <article>
              <div><span class="plan-name">Free</span><strong>$0</strong><small>forever</small></div>
              <p>One connected website with the intelligence core and useful monthly workflow limits.</p>
              <ul>
                <li>1 connected website</li>
                <li>25 Page Investigations / month</li>
                <li>10 Page Battles / month</li>
                <li>5 Content Briefs / month</li>
              </ul>
              <a class="button button--ink" href={`${rankTwigUrl}/login?intent=connect-gsc`}>Start free <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
            </article>

            <article class="plan--pro">
              <div><span class="plan-name">Pro</span><strong>$29</strong><small>per month</small></div>
              <p>More sites, generous workflow capacity, MCP, URL Groups and exports.</p>
              <ul>
                <li>Up to 5 connected websites</li>
                <li>500 Investigations · 200 Battles</li>
                <li>100 Content Briefs / month</li>
                <li>ChatGPT + MCP, groups and exports</li>
              </ul>
              <a class="button button--orange" href={`${rankTwigUrl}/pricing`}>See Pro <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="faq-section shell" aria-labelledby="faq-title">
        <div class="faq-heading">
          <p class="section-number">06 / BEFORE YOU CONNECT IT</p>
          <h2 id="faq-title">A few sensible questions.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-list">
          <details>
            <summary>Why not just use Search Console?</summary>
            <p>Search Console is the source of truth. RankTwig adds the workflow around it: comparisons, opportunity signals, page evidence, investigations, battles, briefs and optional AI reasoning.</p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>Does RankTwig modify my Search Console data?</summary>
            <p>No. The Google Search Console connection is read-only. RankTwig cannot change your property through that permission.</p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>Do I need an AI key?</summary>
            <p>No. Pages, keywords, opportunities, deterministic signals and SEO Health work without one. Connect a supported provider only when you want AI reasoning.</p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>Does it guarantee rankings?</summary>
            <p>No. RankTwig provides evidence and decision support. It keeps limitations visible instead of turning observations into promises.</p>
          </details>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="closing" aria-labelledby="closing-title">
        <div class="closing-art" style={`--hero-image: url('${heroImage}')`} aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="shell closing-copy">
          <p class="section-number">THE NEXT MOVE IS PROBABLY ALREADY THERE</p>
          <h2 id="closing-title">Follow the evidence.</h2>
          <p>Connect Search Console. Let RankTwig show you what deserves attention. Decide with the source still attached.</p>
          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a class="button button--orange" href={`${rankTwigUrl}/login?intent=connect-gsc`}>Put my search data to work <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
            <a class="button button--quiet" href={`${rankTwigUrl}/demo`}>Look around first</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <a class="brand brand--footer" href="#top" aria-label="Back to the top">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" aria-hidden="true">
          <rect width="40" height="40" rx="10" fill="currentColor"></rect>
          <path d="M8.5 30.2c4.1-3 7.7-6.4 10-10.2 1.7-2.8 2.7-5.8 3.1-9.3.1-1.1 1.8-1.1 1.9 0 .1 2.8-.6 5.6-1.4 7.7 2.7-2.1 5.5-4 8.4-5.7.9-.5 1.7.7 1.1 1.5-4.4 6.3-10.5 10.7-17.6 13 4.2.1 8 .8 11.4 2.1 1 .4.8 1.9-.3 2-5.6-.4-11.2-.8-18 1.6-1 .3-1.7-1.1-.8-1.7 1.6-1.2 2.1-1.8 2.6-2.7Z" fill="white"></path>
        </svg>
        <span>RankTwig</span>
      </a>
      <p>Evidence-first SEO intelligence. Built by Naman.</p>
      <div><a href={`${rankTwigUrl}/privacy`}>Privacy</a><a href={`${rankTwigUrl}/terms`}>Terms</a><a href="mailto:team@ranktwig.com">Contact</a></div>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>

<style is:global>
  :root {
    --navy: #101a3d;
    --navy-deep: #0b122d;
    --blue: #6f91ea;
    --blue-soft: #c6d3f6;
    --cream: #fff2dd;
    --paper: #f5f1e8;
    --ink: #171817;
    --muted: #65635d;
    --orange: #f36b00;
    --rule: #d5d0c5;
    --sans: Inter, Geist, "SF Pro Display", "Segoe UI", system-ui, sans-serif;
    --serif: Georgia, Cambria, "Times New Roman", serif;
    --mono: "SFMono-Regular", Consolas, "Liberation Mono", monospace;
  }

  *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }
  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink); font-family: var(--sans); -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }
  body { min-width: 20rem; margin: 0; background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink); line-height: 1.6; }
  img, svg { display: block; max-width: 100%; }
  a { color: inherit; text-underline-offset: .22em; }
  ::selection { background: #ffd1af; color: var(--ink); }
  :focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--orange); outline-offset: 4px; }

  .skip-link { position: fixed; z-index: 100; top: .75rem; left: .75rem; padding: .7rem 1rem; color: white; background: var(--orange); transform: translateY(-160%); }
  .skip-link:focus { transform: translateY(0); }

  .shell { width: min(100% - clamp(2.2rem, 8vw, 6rem), 76rem); margin-inline: auto; }
  .site-header { position: absolute; z-index: 20; top: 0; left: 50%; width: min(100% - clamp(2rem, 6vw, 5rem), 82rem); min-height: 4.6rem; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr; align-items: center; gap: 2rem; color: #f5f5f2; transform: translateX(-50%); }
  .brand { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: .62rem; justify-self: start; color: var(--orange); font-size: .98rem; font-weight: 760; letter-spacing: -.03em; text-decoration: none; }
  .brand svg { width: 1.72rem; height: 1.72rem; }
  .brand span { color: #f5f5f2; }
  .site-header nav { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: clamp(1.15rem, 2.5vw, 2rem); }
  .site-header nav a, .header-action { font-size: .69rem; font-weight: 580; text-decoration: none; }
  .site-header nav a { color: rgb(245 245 242 / 68%); }
  .site-header nav a:hover { color: #fff; }
  .header-action { justify-self: end; padding: .55rem .78rem; border: 1px solid rgb(255 255 255 / 34%); border-radius: .62rem; color: #f8f8f5; background: rgb(255 255 255 / 2%); }
  .header-action:hover { border-color: rgb(255 255 255 / 58%); background: rgb(255 255 255 / 5%); }

  .hero { position: relative; min-height: clamp(54rem, 100svh, 64rem); display: block; overflow: hidden; color: #f7f7f4; background: #070b0b; isolation: isolate; }
  .hero::before { content: ""; position: absolute; z-index: 0; inset: 0; pointer-events: none; background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 77%, rgb(243 107 0 / 13%), transparent 23%), radial-gradient(circle at 6% 90%, rgb(58 77 255 / 28%), transparent 25%), radial-gradient(circle at 94% 90%, rgb(55 75 255 / 28%), transparent 25%), linear-gradient(180deg, #070b0b 0%, #070b0b 53%, #081018 100%); }
  .hero::after { content: ""; position: absolute; z-index: 1; left: 50%; bottom: -3.5rem; width: min(78rem, 108vw); height: 56%; pointer-events: none; background-image: var(--hero-image); background-repeat: no-repeat; background-position: center bottom; background-size: cover; opacity: .96; transform: translateX(-50%); -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent 0%, rgb(0 0 0 / 22%) 8%, #000 24%, #000 100%); mask-image: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent 0%, rgb(0 0 0 / 22%) 8%, #000 24%, #000 100%); }
  .hero-veil { position: absolute; z-index: 2; inset: 0; pointer-events: none; background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgb(7 11 11 / 18%) 0%, transparent 44%, transparent 76%, rgb(7 11 11 / 26%) 100%), radial-gradient(ellipse 38% 21% at 50% 72%, rgb(243 107 0 / 12%), transparent 72%); }
  .hero-veil::after { content: ""; position: absolute; inset: 0; opacity: .12; background-image: radial-gradient(rgb(255 255 255 / 42%) .45px, transparent .55px); background-size: 4px 4px; mix-blend-mode: soft-light; }
  .hero-inner { position: relative; z-index: 3; width: min(100% - clamp(2.2rem, 8vw, 6rem), 76rem); margin-inline: auto; padding: clamp(8.3rem, 15vh, 10rem) 0 30rem; }
  .hero-copy { width: min(52rem, 92%); margin-inline: auto; text-align: center; }
  .eyebrow, .section-number { margin: 0; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: .67rem; font-weight: 650; letter-spacing: .13em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .eyebrow { width: fit-content; max-width: 100%; margin-inline: auto; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: .48rem; padding: .34rem .58rem; border: 1px solid rgb(255 255 255 / 18%); border-radius: 999px; color: rgb(245 245 242 / 72%); background: rgb(255 255 255 / 3%); letter-spacing: .02em; text-transform: none; backdrop-filter: blur(8px); }
  .eyebrow span { width: .36rem; height: .36rem; flex: 0 0 auto; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--orange); box-shadow: 0 0 0 .2rem rgb(243 107 0 / 12%); }
  .eyebrow b { color: rgb(245 245 242 / 55%); font-weight: 500; }
  .hero h1 { max-width: 13ch; margin: 1.22rem auto 0; font-family: var(--sans); font-size: clamp(3.25rem, 5.65vw, 5.75rem); font-weight: 520; line-height: .96; letter-spacing: -.06em; text-wrap: balance; }
  .hero-intro { max-width: 43rem; margin: 1.35rem auto 0; color: rgb(234 238 239 / 55%); font-size: clamp(.94rem, 1.18vw, 1.05rem); line-height: 1.65; }
  .hero-actions { margin-top: 1.65rem; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: .65rem; }
  .button { min-height: 2.85rem; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: .5rem; padding: .68rem 1rem; border: 1px solid transparent; border-radius: .58rem; font-size: .76rem; font-weight: 680; text-decoration: none; transition: transform 220ms ease, background-color 160ms ease, border-color 160ms ease; }
  .button:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); }
  .button--orange { color: #111; background: #f6f5ef; }
  .button--orange:hover { background: #fff; }
  .button--quiet { color: #f2f2ef; border-color: rgb(255 255 255 / 28%); background: rgb(255 255 255 / 2%); }
  .button--quiet:hover { border-color: rgb(255 255 255 / 52%); background: rgb(255 255 255 / 5%); }
  .button--ink { color: var(--cream); background: var(--ink); border-radius: 0; }
  .hero-notes { margin: 1rem auto 0; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; gap: .4rem 1.15rem; color: rgb(219 227 250 / 55%); font-family: var(--mono); font-size: .59rem; list-style: none; }
  .hero-notes li::before { content: "·"; margin-right: .42rem; color: var(--orange); }
  .hero-caption { position: absolute; z-index: 4; right: clamp(1.2rem, 4vw, 3.6rem); bottom: 1.2rem; margin: 0; color: rgb(255 255 255 / 34%); font-family: var(--mono); font-size: .58rem; letter-spacing: .04em; }

  .opening { padding-block: clamp(5rem, 10vw, 9rem); }
  .section-number { color: #8f3d18; }
  .opening-grid { margin-top: 1.4rem; display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.1fr) minmax(18rem, .7fr); gap: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 8rem); align-items: start; }
  .opening h2, .section-heading h2, .proof-section h2, .ai-section h2, .faq-section h2, .closing h2 { margin: 0; font-family: var(--serif); font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 5.2vw, 5.1rem); font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.02; letter-spacing: -.055em; text-wrap: balance; }
  .opening-copy { padding-top: .5rem; color: var(--muted); }
  .opening-copy > p { margin: 0; font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.8; }
  .aside-note { margin-top: 2rem !important; padding: 1.2rem 0 0 1.2rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); border-left: 3px solid var(--orange); font-family: var(--mono) !important; font-size: .72rem !important; line-height: 1.75 !important; }

  .trail-section { padding-block: clamp(5rem, 9vw, 8rem); color: var(--cream); background: var(--navy-deep); }
  .trail-section .section-number, .proof-section .section-number, .closing .section-number { color: var(--blue); }
  .section-heading { max-width: 49rem; }
  .section-heading h2 { margin-top: 1.25rem; }
  .section-heading > p:last-child { max-width: 39rem; margin: 1.45rem 0 0; color: var(--muted); font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.75; }
  .trail-section .section-heading > p:last-child { color: #aebde5; }
  .trail-list { margin: 4rem 0 0; padding: 0; border-top: 1px solid rgb(111 145 234 / 28%); list-style: none; }
  .trail-list li { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 4rem minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(10rem, .42fr); gap: 2rem; align-items: center; padding: 1.65rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(111 145 234 / 28%); }
  .trail-index, .trail-proof { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: .65rem; }
  .trail-index { color: var(--blue); }
  .trail-list strong { display: block; font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 1.55rem; font-weight: 400; }
